{"id":"wb-4-14","name":"羑里城遗址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"羑里城遗址","text":"羑里城遗址（牖里）位于中国河南省安阳市汤阴县城北4公里，面积约1公顷。该地于新石器时代即有人类活动，商代为监狱之一，周文王曾被商纣王拘于此，修订《易经》，现存包括龙山文化和商周时期文化遗址，基本保存完好。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%BE%91%E9%87%8C%E5%9F%8E%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80","revisionId":88969968,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=88969968","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/7a3da31eeed449477216139e.jpg","title":"20250831_Site_of_Youlicheng_02.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20250831_Site_of_Youlicheng_02.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/20/20250831_Site_of_Youlicheng_02.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​羑里城遗址 山门","width":320,"height":213}}